@startuml 05-dialogue-ai
!pragma layout smetana
title Dialogo NPC e AI - Facade

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class LevelScreen <<Boundary>>
class NpcDialogueController <<Controller>>
class DialogueSession
class NpcDialogueService <<Facade>>
class AiService <<Facade>>
interface AiClient <<Gateway>>
class OllamaAiClient <<Adapter>>

LevelScreen --> NpcDialogueController : sessione
NpcDialogueController *-- DialogueSession
LevelScreen --> NpcDialogueService : input + storia
NpcDialogueService --> AiService : richiesta
AiService --> AiClient
AiClient <|.. OllamaAiClient

note bottom of NpcDialogueService
Minimo: il dialogo passa da una facade che nasconde prompt, AI e fallback.
end note
@enduml
